WEBVTT

00:01:29.752 --> 00:01:33.548
In the United States,
a four-year bachelor's degree

00:01:33.548 --> 00:01:36.884
can cost in excess of 100,000 dollars,

00:01:36.926 --> 00:01:39.762
and that price point
continues to escalate.

00:01:41.013 --> 00:01:43.141
And this is true
in other parts of the world,

00:01:43.141 --> 00:01:44.892
but sometimes, the cost is high

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:49.105
because there is no university nearby
to study, on- or off-line.

00:01:50.356 --> 00:01:55.194
Or because the academic
hurdles are so high

00:01:55.236 --> 00:01:58.239
that university is only afforded
to the privileged few.